{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:37:56+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sea of Thieves: 2026 Edition", "steam_appid": 1172620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4373290, 4373360, 4373370, 2838630, 2838640, 3937210], "detailed_description": "<h1>Upgrade Your Adventure</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/3e6b6fae5f08bab56298a29e87da0c16.avif?t=1793617680\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sea of Thieves: Premium Edition </i> </strong>  <br>The 2026 Premium Edition includes the base game and all the following bonus content from the 2026 Deluxe Edition: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sovereign Hat, Dress, Jacket, Boots, Belt, Trousers and Gloves </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardinal Lodestar weapons </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10,000 gold to spend in the Outpost shops </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition of the game also comes with a further Premium Bundle containing: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardinal Lodestar Cat, Costume Set, Flag, Hull, Figurehead, Sails, Cannons, Cannon Flare, Capstan, Wheel, Collector’s Figurehead, Collector’s Sails and Ship’s Crest </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000 Ancient Coins for use in the Pirate Emporium </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/ed4f31a78c3ff390ce84668d9970e738.avif?t=1793617680\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sea of Thieves: Deluxe Edition</i></strong><i>  </i>  <br>The 2026 Deluxe Edition includes the base game and a further Deluxe Bundle containing the following: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sovereign Hat, Dress, Jacket, Boots, Belt, Trousers and Gloves </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardinal Lodestar weapon set </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10,000 gold to spend in the Outpost shops </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sea of Thieves</i> offers the essential pirate experience, from sailing and fighting to exploring and looting – everything you need to live the pirate life and become a legend in your own right. With no set roles, you have complete freedom to approach the world, and other players, however you choose.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re voyaging as a group or sailing solo, you’re bound to encounter other crews in this shared world adventure – but will they be friends or foes, and how will you respond? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/cfb255ca4ec836dbf11f1a46dd8b851c.avif?t=1793617680\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Seas</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sea of Thieves</i> encourages you to pick a point on the horizon and set sail to uncover all that awaits, from the deepest underground passages to the highest island peaks. Wherever you go, there’s always something for inquisitive players to unearth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/83613f25307b472b815489e0452ba710.avif?t=1793617680\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Excitement Never Ends</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <i>Sea of Thieves</i> session is unpredictable. Even a simple Voyage to a tranquil island can unfold into a skeleton ambush, a pitched battle against a fleet of Ghost Ships or a daring chase in pursuit of rival pirates making off with your plunder! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/2a7dacd243ff67dee4baaa70e0ffbd7f.avif?t=1793617680\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Legend</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey to become a Pirate Legend you’ll amass loot, build a reputation and define a unique personal style with your hard-earned rewards. Adventurer. Explorer. Conqueror. What will your legend be? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/61b54872c096336ac0613a5b886aa3e6.avif?t=1793617680\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game That’s Always Growing</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new Season of <i>Sea of Thieves</i> improves and expands upon game features while delivering a calendar of themed and recurring Live Events. Check back regularly to see what’s been added, even as you climb the 50 levels of the free Season Pass to unlock a wealth of rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Bonuses</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional digital bonuses* include access to the latest version of the <i>Sea of Thieves</i> Original Soundtrack, the <i>Sea of Thieves: Athena's Fortune</i> audiobook and The Rough Guide to <i>Sea of Thieves</i> eBook. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Available to download from  (website login required) or via Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sea of Thieves</i> offers the essential pirate experience, from sailing and fighting to exploring and looting – everything you need to live the pirate life and become a legend in your own right. With no set roles, you have complete freedom to approach the world, and other players, however you choose.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re voyaging as a group or sailing solo, you’re bound to encounter other crews in this shared world adventure – but will they be friends or foes, and how will you respond? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/cfb255ca4ec836dbf11f1a46dd8b851c.avif?t=1793617680\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Seas</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sea of Thieves</i> encourages you to pick a point on the horizon and set sail to uncover all that awaits, from the deepest underground passages to the highest island peaks. Wherever you go, there’s always something for inquisitive players to unearth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/83613f25307b472b815489e0452ba710.avif?t=1793617680\" width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Excitement Never Ends</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <i>Sea of Thieves</i> session is unpredictable. Even a simple Voyage to a tranquil island can unfold into a skeleton 